idlepilot notices

This notice only records the boundary around third-party material. Third-party
components in binary distributions retain their own copyright and license
terms, including the Rust standard library, glibc, libgcc, the ELF loader, and
other toolchain and operating-system components.

The idlepilot source distribution contains no bundled third-party source code
and the Rust package declares no third-party Cargo dependencies. See
THIRD_PARTY.md for the release-time dependency statement. Binary distributions
must also carry the exact Rust standard-library notice bundle identified there,
under share/doc/idlepilot/rust/. The release SPDX SBOM separately records the
statically linked Rust library and every dynamically linked system-library name
reported by the exact ELF.
